    "questionText": "Applecross SHS Semester 1, 2020 Section 2 Mathematics Methods Unit 1&2 9 See next page DO NOT WRITE IN THIS SECTION AS IT WILL BE CUT OFF. Question 15 (8 marks) Consider part of the unit circle shown below, where 𝜃= 51°. Determine, in terms of 𝑝 and / or 𝑞, an expression for each of the following: (a) sin 51°. (1 mark) (b) cos 129°. (2 marks) (c) sin 141°. (2 marks) (d) cos 258°. (3 marks)",
