    "questionText": "CALCULATOR-ASSUMED 10 METHODS UNIT 1 See next page SN018-132-2 Question 15 (7 marks) An obtuse angled triangle 𝑊𝑊𝑊𝑊𝑊𝑊 has 𝑤𝑤= 45 cm, 𝑦𝑦= 34 cm and an area of 739 cm2. (a) Sketch a triangle to show this information. (1 mark) (b) Determine the size of ∠𝑋𝑋. (2 marks) (c) Show that 𝑥𝑥≈63 cm. (2 marks) (d) Show that ∠𝑌𝑌≈31°. (2 marks)",
    "answerText": "METHODS UNIT 1 10 CALCULATOR-ASSUMED See next page SN018-132-8 Question 15 (7 marks) An obtuse angled triangle 𝑊𝑊𝑊𝑊𝑊𝑊 has 𝑤𝑤= 45 cm, 𝑦𝑦= 34 cm and an area of 739 cm2. (a) Sketch a triangle to show this information. (1 mark) (b) Determine the size of ∠𝑋𝑋. (2 marks) (c) Show that 𝑥𝑥≈63 cm. (2 marks) (d) Show that ∠𝑌𝑌≈31°. (2 marks) Solution 739 = 1 2(34)(45) sin 𝑋𝑋 𝑋𝑋= 104.98 ≈105° Specific behaviours  substitutes into area equation  correct (obtuse) angle Solution 𝑥𝑥2 = 342 + 452 −2(34)(45) cos 104.98 𝑥𝑥= 63.02 ≈63 cm Specific behaviours  uses appropriate equation that includes 𝑥𝑥  substitutes correctly and solves to at least 1 dp Solution 34 sin 𝑌𝑌= 63.02 sin 104.98 ∠𝑌𝑌= 31.4 ≈31° Specific behaviours  uses appropriate equation that includes 𝑌𝑌  substitutes correctly and solves to at least 1 dp Solution Specific behaviours  triangle with all information",
