    "questionText": "METHODS UNIT 1 4 CALCULATOR-ASSUMED See next page DO NOT WRITE IN THIS AREA AS IT WILL BE CUT OFF Question 10 (5 marks) Shape 𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴 below consists of sector 𝐵𝐵𝐵𝐵𝐵𝐵 of circle centre 𝑂𝑂 joined to sector 𝐷𝐷𝐷𝐷𝐷𝐷 of a different circle, also centre 𝑂𝑂. 𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴 is a straight line of length 65 cm, arc 𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴 is 12 cm long and ∠𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴= 0.32 radians. (a) Determine the length 𝑂𝑂𝑂𝑂. (2 marks) (b) Determine the area of the shape. (3 marks)",
    "answerText": "METHODS UNIT 1 4 CALCULATOR-ASSUMED See next page Question 10 (5 marks) Shape 𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴 below consists of sector 𝐵𝐵𝐵𝐵𝐵𝐵 of circle centre 𝑂𝑂 joined to sector 𝐷𝐷𝐷𝐷𝐷𝐷 of a different circle, also centre 𝑂𝑂. 𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴 is a straight line of length 65 cm, arc 𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴 is 12 cm long and ∠𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴𝐴= 0.32 radians. (a) Determine the length 𝑂𝑂𝑂𝑂. (2 marks) (b) Determine the area of the shape. (3 marks) Solution Let 𝑂𝑂𝑂𝑂= 𝑅𝑅 so that 0.32𝑅𝑅= 12 𝑅𝑅= 37.5 cm Specific behaviours  correct use of arc length  correct length Solution 𝐴𝐴𝐷𝐷𝐷𝐷𝐷𝐷= 1 2 × 37.52 × 0.32 = 225 Let 𝑂𝑂𝑂𝑂= 𝑟𝑟 𝑟𝑟= 65 −37.5 = 27.5 𝐴𝐴𝐵𝐵𝐵𝐵𝐵𝐵= 1 2 × 27.52(𝜋𝜋−0.32) = 1067 Area = 225 + 1067 = 1 292 cm2 Specific behaviours  area of sector 𝐷𝐷𝐷𝐷𝐷𝐷  radius and angle of sector 𝐵𝐵𝐵𝐵𝐵𝐵  area of shape",
