    "questionText": "CALCULATOR-ASSUMED 17 METHODS UNIT 1 See next page DO NOT WRITE IN THIS AREA AS IT WILL BE CUT OFF Question 21 (5 marks) Consider part of the unit circle shown below. Determine, in terms of 𝑎𝑎 and/or 𝑏𝑏, an expression for each of the following (a) cos 𝛿𝛿°. (1 mark) (b) sin(180° −𝛿𝛿°). (1 mark) (c) cos(90° −𝛿𝛿°). (1 mark) (d) sin(2𝛿𝛿°). (2 marks)",
    "answerText": "CALCULATOR-ASSUMED 17 METHODS UNIT 1 See next page Question 21 (5 marks) Consider part of the unit circle shown below. Determine, in terms of 𝑎𝑎 and / or 𝑏𝑏, an expression for each of the following: (a) cos 𝛿𝛿°. (1 mark) (b) sin(180° −𝛿𝛿°). (1 mark) (c) cos(𝛿𝛿° −90°). (1 mark) (d) sin(2𝛿𝛿°). (2 marks) Solution cos 𝛿𝛿° = 𝑎𝑎 Specific behaviours  correct expression Solution sin(180° −𝛿𝛿°) = sin 𝛿𝛿° = 𝑏𝑏 Specific behaviours  correct expression Solution cos(𝛿𝛿° −90°) = sin𝛾𝛾 = 𝑏𝑏 Specific behaviours  correct expression Solution sin(2𝛾𝛾°) = sin(𝛿𝛿° + 𝛿𝛿°) = sin𝛿𝛿° cos 𝛿𝛿° + cos 𝛿𝛿° sin𝛿𝛿° = (𝑏𝑏)(𝑎𝑎) + (𝑎𝑎)(𝑏𝑏) = 2𝑎𝑎𝑎𝑎 Specific behaviours  halves angle and uses sum identity  correct expression",
