    "answerText": "METHODS UNIT 1 10 CALCULATOR-FREE End of questions SN044-152-3 Question 8 (8 marks) (a) Determine an exact value for os103° os 58° + sin 103° sin 58°. (2 marks) (b) Determine all possible values of t n 𝜃 when sin 𝜃= 2 3 . (3 marks) (c) Determine an exact value for sin75°. (3 marks) Solution sin 75° = sin(30° + 45°) = sin30° os 45° + os30° sin 45° = 1 2 × √2 2 + √3 2 × √2 2 = √2 + √6 4 Specific behaviours ✓ uses double angle formula ✓ uses correct exact values ✓ simplifies to obtain final value Solution 𝑎= √ −4 = √5 Note that 𝜃 can be in quadrant 1 or 2. n Q1: t n 𝜃= 2 √5 , in Q2 t n 𝜃= −2 √5 Specific behaviours ✓ relevant use of right triangle ✓ one correct value ✓ both correct values Solution os 103° os 58° + sin103° sin 58° = os(103° −58°) = os 45° = √2 2 Specific behaviours ✓ uses double angle formula ✓ states exact value",
