    "questionText": "CALCULATOR-ASSUMED 3 METHODS UNIT 1 See next page SN085-192-2 DO NOT WRITE IN THIS AREA AS IT WILL BE CUT OFF Section Two: Calculator-assumed 65% (96 Marks) This section has twelve questions. Answer all questions. Write your answers in the spaces provided. Working time: 100 minutes. Question 8 (6 marks) Four points have coordinates 𝐴(1, −1), 𝐵(−14, 5), 𝐶(𝑠, 𝑡) and 𝐷(3, 5). (i) If 𝐴 is the midpoint of 𝐵 and 𝐶, determine the value of the constant 𝑠 and the value of the constant 𝑡. (2 marks) (ii) Determine the equation of the line that is perpendicular to 𝐴𝐵 and that passes through 𝐷 in the form 𝑎𝑥+ 𝑏𝑦+ 𝑐= 0, where 𝑎, 𝑏 and 𝑐 are integers and 𝑎> 0. (4 marks)",
