    "questionText": "CALCULATOR-ASSUMED 5 METHODS UNIT 1 See next page SN085-232-2 DO NOT WRITE IN THIS AREA AS IT WILL BE CUT OFF SN085-232-2 DO NOT WRITE IN THIS AREA AS IT WILL BE CUT OFF Section Two: Calculator-assumed 65% (98 Marks) This section has twelve questions. Answer all questions. Write your answers in the spaces provided. Working time: 100 minutes. Question 7 (6 marks) Given that P(𝐴𝐴) = 0.3 and P(𝐵𝐵) = 0.5, determine the value of P(𝐴𝐴∪𝐵𝐵) in each of the following different situations. (a) 𝐴𝐴 and 𝐵𝐵 are mutually exclusive. (2 marks) (b) 𝑃𝑃(𝐴𝐴|𝐵𝐵) = 0.8. (2 marks) (c) 𝐴𝐴 and 𝐵𝐵 are independent. (2 marks)",
