    "questionText": "Applecross SHS Semester 1, 2019 Section 2 Mathematics Methods Unit 1&2 12 See next page DO NOT WRITE IN THIS SECTION AS IT WILL BE CUT OFF. Question 18 (6 marks) Let 𝑎= sin 50° and 𝑏= cos100°. Give your answers to the following in terms of 𝑎 and/or 𝑏. (a) Write down an expression for (i) sin130°. (1 mark) (ii) cos80°. (1 mark) (b) Determine an expression for cos 130°. (3 marks) (c) Determine an expression for tan 130°. (1 mark)",
    "answerText": "METHODS UNIT 1 12 CALCULATOR-ASSUMED See next page SN002-132-4 Question 18 (6 marks) Let 𝑎= sin 50° and 𝑏= cos 100°. Give your answers to the following in terms of 𝑎 and/or 𝑏. (a) Write down an expression for (i) sin130°. (1 mark) (ii) cos80°. (1 mark) (b) Determine an expression for cos 130°. (3 marks) (c) Determine an expression for tan 130°. (1 mark) Solution sin130° = sin 50° = 𝑎 Specific behaviours ✓ correct expression Solution cos 80° = −cos100° = −𝑏 Specific behaviours ✓ correct expression Solution tan 130° = sin 130° cos 130° = − 𝑎 √1 −𝑎2 Specific behaviours ✓ correct expression Solution cos2 130° + sin2 130° = 1 cos2 130° = 1 −𝑎2 cos130° = ±√1 −𝑎2 but cos130° < 0 ⇒cos130° = −√1 −𝑎2 Specific behaviours ✓ indicates use of sin2 𝜃+ cos2 𝜃= 1 ✓ expression for cos2 130° ✓ correct expression",
