    "questionText": "Applecross SHS Semester 1, 2019 Section 2 Mathematics Methods Unit 1&2 15 END OF QUESTIONS DO NOT WRITE IN THIS SECTION AS IT WILL BE CUT OFF. Question 21 (8 marks) (a) The circle shown has centre 𝑂 and diameter 𝐴𝐶 of length 50 cm. Determine the shaded area given that 2 × ∠𝐴𝑂𝐵= 3 × ∠𝐵𝑂𝐶. (4 marks) (b) A sector of a circle has a perimeter of 112 cm and an area of 735 cm2. Determine the radius of the circle. (4 marks) Applecross SHS Semester 1, 2019 Section 2 Mathematics Methods Unit 1&2 16 END OF EXAMINATION BOOKLET DO NOT WRITE IN THIS SECTION AS IT WILL BE CUT OFF. Additional working space. Question Number: _________",
