    "answerText": "Page 3 of 4 Question 5. [5 marks: 1, 2, 2] The binomial coefficients in the eighth row of Pascal's triangle are 1,8,28,56,… and so on. (a) Deduce the value of i) ቀ8 6ቁ ii) ቀ9 7ቁ (b) The sum of all but one of the binomial coefficients in the eighth row of Pascal's triangle is 186. Determine, with justification, the value of the missing coefficient. Using symmetry property ቀ𝑎𝑎 𝑏𝑏ቁ= ቀ𝑎𝑎 𝑎𝑎−𝑏𝑏ቁ then ቀ8 6ቁ=ቀ8 2ቁ=28 ቀ9 7ቁ=ቀ8 6ቁ+ቀ8 7ቁ=28 + 8 = 36 OR ቀ9 7ቁ=9!/7!2!=36 OR ቀ9 2ቁ=36 Sum of the row is 28=256 Missing Coefficient is 256 – 186 = 70",
